The [SubjectAccessReview API documentation](/docs/reference/kubernetes-api/authorization-resources/subject-access-review-v1/)

Docs page "Webhook Mode", section "Request Payloads". gives guidelines for how these fields should be interpreted and handled by authorization webhooks,
